  "description": "NHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics.Abstractions provides the contracts a host implements to use\n\t\t\tNHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics.Clients: the audit, metric and security audit models, the\n\t\t\tstorage, identity, dispatcher and request trace ports, and the storage exceptions an\n\t\t\timplementation raises.",
