  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.5.0.0\n\t\t\t- Released alongside NHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics.Clients 0.5.0.0, as the two packages always ship at the same version.\n\t\t\t- Breaking for every host that implements the storage port: ISecurityAudit has a new Operation property (string, optional), what was accessed: an endpoint as its method and route, such as \"POST api/STU3/Patient/$getstructuredrecord\", or a fully qualified operation or namespace name. Your SecurityAudit entity must implement it, and your database needs a new column for it and a migration: nullable, up to 500 characters (nvarchar(500) on SQL Server). Existing rows keep NULL.\n\t\t\t- The IAuditAndMetricStorageBroker methods are unchanged: they take the entity, which now carries the operation.\n\t\t\t- Upgrade guide: https://github.com/NHSISL/NHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics#upgrading-from-04x",
